nd on-call has been paged. It describes the bad deploy and the rollback, and lists confirming recovery and finding what's wrong in v5.1.0 as follow-ups.\n\nv5.1.0 shouldn't be redeployed until the cause is found and fixed.", "type": "text"}]}]}